      "lines": [
        "家庭作业题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "457",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简下列各式：",
        "1) $x+(y-x)-(y-3)$；",
        "2) $-(a-b)-b+(-a-7)$；",
        "3) $-(m-n)+(m-7)-n$；",
        "4) $(13-x)-(13-y)+x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "458",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "写出下列每两式的差并化简：",
        "1) $m-13$和$17+m$；3) $-c+b$和$b-3-c$；",
        "2) $a+12$和$15-a$；　　4) $a-b+8$和$8+b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "459",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程：",
        "1) $14-(35+x)=12$；2) $3.3-(x-6.7)=100$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "460",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "电视机售价240卢布.降价后的价格是204卢布.电",
        "视机的价格降低了百分之几？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "461",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知长方形的三个顶点坐标是：$A(-2,-1),B(-2,3)$，",
        "$C(6,3)$，作长方形$ABCD$.求顶点$D$和对角线$AC$和$BD$",
        "的交点坐标."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "462",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作端点坐标为$N(1,4)$和$T(3,2)$的线段$NT$.作线段",
        "$NT$的关于$Ox$轴的对称线段$CD$以及关于$Oy$轴的对",
        "称线段$AB$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "463",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在纸上作长方形$ABCD$和与这个长方形不相交的直线$l$.",
        "把纸沿直线$l$折叠起来，在长方形的顶点扎眼.然后把",
        "纸展开，按针眼作长方形$ABCD$的关于直线$l$的对称长",
        "方形."
      ]
    },
